# Architecture Documentation Sync

Update `.claude/references/architecture-documentation.md` only when current
public architecture changes: feature/package boundaries, domain models,
services, use cases, contract-owning shared components, state ownership, or
navigation.

Never update it for AppStyle tokens, presentation-only components (backgrounds,
styling wrappers), private refactors, layout-only edits, or test expectations.

Route to one section using
`.claude/skills/reviewing-code-changes/references/architecture-routing.md`;
never rewrite the whole document for a local change.
